# Stray build artifacts: stale build/<pkg> dirs left over from packages that
# used to be ament_python (setup.py + <pkg>/<pkg>/ module layout) can make
# CMake's linker write a compiled executable straight into the source tree
# at <pkg>/<pkg> once the package is re-pointed at CMakeLists.txt/ament_cmake
# (see face_detection/face_detection, added by mistake in 6c978d7). Ignore
# that exact self-named path per already-ported package so a `git add -A`
# can't recommit one.
/face_detection/face_detection
/person_detection/person_detection
/animate_behavior/animate_behavior
/gesture_execution/gesture_execution
/overt_attention/overt_attention

# VS Code workspace state. browse.vc.db is the C++ IntelliSense index and
# reaches ~1.2 GB per package -- it was the single largest thing in this
# workspace before being deleted twice.
.vscode/
